Version 4
SymbolType BLOCK
RECTANGLE Normal 80 64 -48 -48
WINDOW 0 16 -48 Bottom 2
WINDOW 3 16 64 Top 2
SYMATTR Value PA340
SYMATTR Prefix X
SYMATTR ModelFile ./PA340_Pspice.LIB
PIN -48 -16 LEFT 8
PINATTR PinName in+
PINATTR SpiceOrder 1
PIN -48 32 LEFT 8
PINATTR PinName in-
PINATTR SpiceOrder 2
PIN 16 -48 TOP 8
PINATTR PinName v+
PINATTR SpiceOrder 3
PIN 16 64 BOTTOM 8
PINATTR PinName v-
PINATTR SpiceOrder 4
PIN 80 -16 RIGHT 8
PINATTR PinName out
PINATTR SpiceOrder 5
PIN 80 16 RIGHT 8
PINATTR PinName c
PINATTR SpiceOrder 6
PIN 80 48 RIGHT 8
PINATTR PinName c
PINATTR SpiceOrder 7
